# Deploy credentials (example for your project)

Copy to **your deploy project's** `config/ded.env` (gitignored there), not into the
ded install directory.

```bash
# DEPLOY_SSH_HOST=your.host.example
# DEPLOY_SSH_USER=root
# DEPLOY_SSH_PORT=22
# SSH_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE=~/.ssh/deploy-key
# ANSIBLE_VAULT_PASSWORD=

# Optional:
# DED_CONFIG=/path/to/your-project/config/ded.json
# DED_ENV=/path/to/your-project/config/ded.env
# CURSOR_API_KEY=            # Cursor Dashboard → API Keys (TUI: press a to launch agent)
# BOT_HOST=            # legacy alias for DEPLOY_SSH_HOST
```

Shell exports override file values.
